iption> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 15:49:27 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/index.png" type="image/png" length="28011" /> </item> <item> <title>全体俯瞰と必読 10 (Essentials)</title> <description>全体俯瞰と必読 10 (Essentials) — SONiC をこれから触る技術者向けの単一ページ入口。1 枚の component 俯瞰図と最低限の用語 4 つで全体像を掴み、そのあとに目的別の必読 10 ページへ降りていく。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/getting-started/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 15:49:27 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/getting-started/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/getting-started.png" type="image/png" length="32978" /> </item> <item> <title>サイトマップ</title> <category>meta</category> <category>sitemap</category> <description>サイトマップ — docs/**/*.md を mkdocs nav 順で階層列挙したインデックス（全 1098 ページ）。meta/scripts/gen_sitemap.py で自動生成。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/sitemap/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 15:49:27 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/sitemap/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/sitemap.png" type="image/png" length="22774" /> </item> <item> <title>SONiC 全体像と設定基盤</title> <description>SONiC 全体像と設定基盤 — この章は、SONiC を読むときに最初に混乱しやすい「設定はどこから入るのか」「Redis DB は何を分担するのか」「変更はどこまで安全に戻せるのか」を、HLD 単位ではなく読者の質問順に並べ直した入口です。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/01-overview/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 15:49:27 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/01-overview/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/01-overview/index.png" type="image/png" length="25599" /> </item> <item> <title>概念と読み始め方</title> <description>概念と読み始め方 — この章は「SONiC をこれから読む人が、最初の数時間でつまずきやすい所」を整理しておく入口です。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/01-overview/concept/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 15:49:27 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/01-overview/concept/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/01-overview/concept.png" type="image/png" length="14251" /> </item> <item> <title>カバレッジ</title> <description>カバレッジ — このページは docs/**/*.md の frontmatter verification フィールドを集計したものです。meta/scripts/gen_coverage.py で自動生成されます。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/coverage/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/coverage/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/coverage.png" type="image/png" length="23000" /> </item> <item> <title>ビルド時間最適化（Dockerfile レイヤ削減 / BuildKit / 並列 dh / sairedis 分離）</title> <description>ビルド時間最適化（Dockerfile レイヤ削減 / BuildKit / 並列 dh / sairedis 分離） — Dockerfile レイヤ最適化・BuildKit キャッシュ活用・並列 dh_make・sairedis 分離ビルドの 4 手法で SONiC のビルド時間を大幅に短縮する設計。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/build-system-improvements/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/build-system-improvements/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/build-system-improvements.png" type="image/png" length="51378" /> </item> <item> <title>DIP=SIP PTF 検証 概念（テストの目的とトポロジ）</title> <description>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テストの概念・目的・トポロジ・対応 testbed を整理する。SONiC が「SRC_IP = DST_IP」のパケットを正しく L3 ルーティングできるかを sonic-mgmt の PTF / pytest で検証するテストインフラ HLD。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-concepts/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-concepts/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-concepts.png" type="image/png" length="31944" /> </item> <item> <title>P4RT App の Read キャッシュ（PI 形式の table_entry_cache_）</title> <description>P4RT App の Read キャッシュ（PI 形式の table_entry_cache_） — P4 Runtime (P4RT) サーバはコントローラから 3 種の操作（Stream / Write / Read）を受ける。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/p4rt-read-cache-hld/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/p4rt-read-cache-hld/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/p4rt-read-cache-hld.png" type="image/png" length="48684" /> </item> <item> <title>CONFIG_DB ↔ orchagent クラス対応表</title> <description>CONFIG_DB ↔ orchagent クラス対応表 — SONiC の CONFIG_DB テーブル が「誰によって読まれるか」を一望できる早見表。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db-orch-map/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db-orch-map/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db-orch-map.png" type="image/png" length="39216" /> </item> <item> <title>config default-route（デフォルトルート設定パターン）</title> <description>config default-route（デフォルトルート設定パターン） — SONiC に config default-route という独立コマンドは存在しないため、用途に応じて vtysh / config route-map / frr 設定ファイル等を使い分けるパターンを解説する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-default-route/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-default-route/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/config-default-route.png" type="image/png" length="38024" /> </item> <item> <title>AUTO_TECHSUPPORT_FEATURE テーブル</title> <description>AUTO_TECHSUPPORT_FEATURE テーブル — AUTO_TECHSUPPORT (GLOBAL) で定義したイベント駆動 techsupport の挙動を、FEATURE (docker) 単位でオーバーライドするテーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport-feature/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport-feature/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport-feature.png" type="image/png" length="35077" /> </item> <item> <title>FEATURE テーブル</title> <description>FEATURE テーブル — SONiC の機能 docker（bgp、teamd、snmp、sflow、telemetry 等）の有効化、自動再起動、起動遅延、scope（global / per-asic / per-dpu）、Kubernetes 管理切り替えを保持する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/feature/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/feature/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/feature.png" type="image/png" length="31658" /> </item> </channel> </rss>